textbook presentation.

163
00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.340 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
Recall our original problem.

164
00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:53.000 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
The factories are placed randomly, and we divide
the workers into

165
00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.260 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
