the total squared distance transportation cost.

169
00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:10.640 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
Now, instead of assigning each worker to a
factory, we let the workers

170
00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:11.700 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
choose for themselves.

171
00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:16.240 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
What we do is assign different wages to
different factories.

172
00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:21.300 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
If factory xi offers wage wi, a worker at

