workers and expands its region.

182
00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:01.860 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
Decreasing its wage has the opposite effect.

183
00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:06.260 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
