shrinks.

184
00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:12.060 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
Wage changes let us rebalance staffing without
assigning each worker individually.

185
00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:17.520 line:94%,end position:50%,center size:90% align:center
Kantorovich duality tells us that we can choose
